{
  "case": "nonlinear_diffusion_accum",
  "pipeline_kind": "mms_convergence",
  "description": "Solved-trajectory Layer-C case for nonlinear_laplacian_uniform = grad(f*grad(u)). Freeze-and-accumulate pattern (as in divergence_arakawa_c): u=sin(2*pi*x) and f=2+sin(2*pi*x) are frozen (D/dt=0) and a state `acc` integrates the operator, so acc(t)=t*grad(f*grad(u)). Exact = t*(2*pi)^2*(cos(4*pi*x) - 2*sin(2*pi*x)). The field-level pipeline (build_ode_problem) sweeps N=16->32 and verifies O(h^2) spatial convergence; the linear-in-time accumulation makes the ODE-solver error negligible, isolating the rule's spatial truncation.",
  "esm": "nonlinear_diffusion_pde.esm",
  "grid_refs": [
    "nl_n16.gdd.json",
    "nl_n32.gdd.json"
  ],
  "mms_kind": "sin2pi_nonlinear_diffusion_accum",
  "t_final": 1.0,
  "convergence": {
    "expected_order": 2.0,
    "min_order": 1.8,
    "comment": "Variable-coefficient O(h^2) operator; observed order 1.92 at N=16->32, floor at 1.8 for cross-environment headroom."
  }
